{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
Damaging a Crowd Controlled enemy makes them and surrounding enemies {c_important}{u}Unstoppable{/u}{/c} but you gain {c_random}[{SF_3}*100|1x%|]{/c} increased Damage, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed for {c_number}{SF_0}{/c} seconds. {if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Gain {c_number}[{SF_15}*100|+%|]{/c} Attack Speed, increased by {c_number}[{SF_8}|+2%|]{/c} for each {c_number}[1|%|]{/c} Damage to Crowd Controlled Enemies you have, up to a maximum of {c_random}[{SF_20}*100|+2%|]{/c}.
Current Bonus: {c_number}[{SF_6}*100|+2%|]{/c}{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
